sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-005: Password Recovery for PART/ADMIN — Request and Link Validation Sequence
    actor User
    participant UI as React Recovery UI
    participant API as Express Auth API
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant Firebase as Firebase Auth + Identity Toolkit
    participant Mail as Email Delivery

    User->>UI: Submit account email
    UI->>UI: Validate and normalize email, preserve it on errors
    alt Invalid email
        UI-->>User: Field error, no request
    else Valid email
        UI->>API: POST /api/auth/password-reset
        API->>API: Enforce per-email cooldown and hourly limit
        API->>DB: Find non-suspended participant
        alt Unknown, suspended, or OAuth-only account
            API-->>UI: Uniform 200 confirmation, no account-type disclosure
        else Credential account
            API->>Firebase: Confirm password provider and request reset link
            Firebase->>Mail: Dispatch Firebase-managed reset email
            alt Delivery or Firebase request fails
                Mail--xAPI: Failure logged without reset secret
                API-->>UI: Same uniform 200 confirmation
                Note over User,API: Anti-enumeration is preserved, but the user receives no delivery-specific retry state.
            else Reset email accepted
                API-->>UI: Same uniform 200 confirmation, no session
                Mail-->>User: Single-use password-reset link
            end
        end
        UI-->>User: Generic check-your-email guidance
    end

    User->>UI: Open reset link
    UI->>UI: Read and remove oobCode from visible URL
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/password-reset/validate
    API->>Firebase: Inspect Firebase action code without consuming it
    alt Expired, invalid, or known-used link
        API-->>UI: Explicit link state, password unchanged
        UI-->>User: Request-new-link or sign-in guidance
    else Link resolves to OAuth-only identity
        API-->>UI: OAUTH_RECOVERY_REQUIRED
        UI-->>User: Use Google or GitHub recovery/sign-in
    else Valid credential reset link
        API-->>UI: Valid state and account email
        UI-->>User: Show new-password and confirmation fields
    end

    Note over User,Firebase: A valid credential link continues in the separate reset-confirmation sequence.<br/>Validation alone never changes the password or creates a session.


